    "concept_prompt": "prompts/c12_concept.txt",
    "full_fusion_brief_en": "Retain the existing white-gray/forest-green/copper Cygni body armor, shoulder wings and Valkyrie-derived chest construction. Adopt the user-selected Anubis-inspired stepped brow and inward angular cheeks, reflective GOLD subtly T-shaped visor with broad eye band and medium-width central stem, compact chin and paired short rear-swept temple fins. Helmet shell matches the white-gray body. Remove the earlier purple visor, thick copper U frame and round cheek knobs; copper remains restrained trim. The selected concept is the helmet authority; supporting sheets must follow it.",
    "actual_reviews": {
      "concept": "採用使用者選定的原始 T 字概念圖，沒有再次生成或改色：上方寬金色眼帶、兩側頰板微內收、中央直向玻璃及短下巴；白灰殼、Anubis 分層眉甲、短側翼與身甲配色延續。",
      "turnaround": "已目視：正面和左側的面窗均為反光金色、下方頰板內收，圓形頰接點改為小黑通風口；冠殼、短側翼和後腦白灰。正／側／背全身與雙腳完整，身甲和獨立 B-12 白橘殼、藍頂、中央金屬筒與下方橫接頭延續。正側玻璃轉折與頰板厚度須在建模時統一。",
      "construction": "已目視：組裝頭盔與拆出的玻璃均改金色，玻璃呈寬眼帶／中央下伸的微 T 形；冠殼、內收頰架與短下巴跟隨已選概念，舊圓形頰鈕已移除。肩部、軟關節、背視小圖及 B-12 配色延續。拆件輪廓和裝配縫只作示意，仍需在模型統一。"
    }
